    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fef42b65e776e715d9c4577",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那位大人的强大――那份光芒，\n正是这个世界中『特别』的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d24f828ce879701f74b7e798002220db4f2a68c7e43fb6e39884dc9f3ae5b41e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
