      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而我，则要在那位大人的前方飞驰，\n亲手触碰那扇通往“彼方之地”的大门。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8adb47c7c1500f4e763b1b07c47d53474a71fc1ee6994b4b42c4ebd6f94a488f",
